{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>You will be put to shame.</b> Like וחפרה הלבנה (Isaiah 24:23). The sense: do not fear while you are in exile:" "<b>Your youth.</b> An allusion to the exile of youth, or an allusion to the First Temple and also the Second, for Israel had many evils intermixed during the days of their kingdom:" "<b>Your widowhood.</b> The loss of kingship:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 54, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:26.218227289Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}